Turn these notes into a CRM-ready DRAFT.
Required fields: {{fields}}
Notes: {{notes}}
Rules: {{rules}}

Extract only information actually present. Preserve amounts, dates, negations, uncertainty, and who promised what. Put “Not stated” in missing fields. Do not turn interest into agreement, a proposal into a decision, or a relative date into a calendar date without an explicit reference date. List contradictory facts separately.
Return: a concise record using my fields; a next-action checklist with the responsible person and due date only if stated; and up to three questions to resolve gaps. Also return a paste-ready plain-text version. Do not write to my CRM or schedule anything.

