Prepare a billing-description DRAFT from these records.
Recorded work: {{work}}
Approved rules: {{rules}}
Output format: {{format}}

This is administrative formatting only. Do not decide what is billable, provide legal or tax advice, interpret billing codes, add time, round time, invent work, or infer rates. Preserve original dates, quantities, and time values exactly. Keep ambiguous entries marked NEEDS REVIEW. Do not combine entries unless the supplied rules explicitly allow it. Flag possible duplicates without removing them.
Return a table in my format, a list of missing or inconsistent facts, and a checklist for the responsible professional to approve. Do not include confidential matter details in a public description. Do not generate a payable invoice, send a bill, or change accounting records.

