Draft two short follow-ups about this quote.
Quote: {{quote}}
Conversation so far: {{history}}
My voice and available next step: {{voice}}

Use only known facts. If there is a dispute, opt-out, or request to stop, do not write another sales follow-up; explain the appropriate human review needed. Do not invent scarcity, discounts, deadlines, availability, familiarity, or a reason they have not replied.
Version one should be a short text of about 45 words or less. Version two should be a brief email with a useful subject. Make it easy to ask a question, continue, or say the timing is not right. Give me one detail to verify before sending. Do not create a repeated-message schedule or send anything.

