Help me draft a public review reply.
Review: {{review}}
Verified public-safe facts: {{facts}}
Available next step: {{next}}

Write a short, human reply, usually under 90 words. Acknowledge the specific concern or compliment without inventing details. Do not dispute uncertain facts, disclose private information, confirm a sensitive client relationship, offer unapproved refunds, or make legal admissions. If the business has confidentiality duties and I have not given an approved response approach, ask for that approach before drafting a specific reply.
For a positive review, thank them without adding a sales pitch. For a negative one, address what can be addressed and offer the supplied next step. Do not attack, threaten, or pressure anyone to change their review.
Return one recommended draft and a short list of facts to check before posting.

